OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to help identify body
OL,4,Arecovered from water
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are working to identify the body
OL,7,Fof a man that was found in the water
OL,8,Foff Poole.
OL,10,FDorset Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fthat the body had been spotted in the
OL,12,Farea of Sandbanks Quay at 08:38 BST on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FHe is described as white, around five
OL,16,Ffeet eight inches tall, of medium to
OL,17,Fstocky build, unshaven with no beard
OL,18,Fand believed to be aged in his 50s with
OL,19,Fshort brown hair.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
